        {
            "id": 12131,
            "question_id": 23760,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "uk",
            "hint": "Лексична основа: cook — готувати їжу. Збережи точну сферу заперечення: дія, її тривалість, якість, учасник, об’єкт або причина. Заперечення однієї ознаки не скасовує всю дію.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:35.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:35.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 12132,
            "question_id": 23760,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Use the past perfect continuous for the earlier process. Start with the main-clause subject; do not move time or reason phrases to the front. Deny cooking as Dad's earlier activity before our return.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:35.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:35.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 12133,
            "question_id": 23760,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Lexical verb: cook. Keep the precise scope of negation: the activity, duration, quality, participant, object or reason. Negating one feature need not deny the activity.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:35.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:35.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 12134,
